{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.084002850204864032,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.1044481739258496,"h":0.03198574007750965,"w":0.25786638895670572,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 5","c":1,"y":0.16674982355144663,"h":0.018244538908150809,"x":0.4072712856406997,"w":0.10109528859456385},{"t":"SECTION 1","y":0.22819767426397697,"w":0.15637860616048177,"h":0.015988372380376759,"x":0.08230452397878163,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","h":0.010174418787512463,"w":0.10288065592447916,"y":0.25872093013030362,"x":0.082304527899768984},{"y":0.25726744173407257,"w":0.17078189849853515,"x":0.18312756917888279,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Hi. Can I help you?"},{"y":0.27470930223044121,"w":0.059670778910318995,"t":"VISITOR:","x":0.082304528133476162,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"t":"Io like to find out if you have any excursions suitable for families.","y":0.27325581381959951,"w":0.51851852416992184,"x":0.19753086125597263,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"y":0.2906360424265817,"h":0.0088339222614841617,"c":1,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","w":0.10082304636637371,"x":0.082304526096648539},{"c":1,"w":0.60302525838216137,"t":"Sure. How about taking your family for a cruise? We have a steamship that","x":0.19540231676060632,"h":0.01731967701367132,"y":0.28761051393059989},{"w":0.53719009399414064,"h":0.016317295663067499,"x":0.19539621046625408,"y":0.30370133680508704,"c":1,"t":"takes passengers out several times a day - it's over 100 years old."},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"y":0.3212209301380391,"x":0.082304526335934061,"c":1,"t":"VISITOR:","w":0.057613169352213542},{"c":1,"x":0.082304526126043012,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.33568904597410698,"w":0.10082304636637369,"h":0.010306242638398078},{"c":1,"t":"That sounds interesting. How long is the trip?","x":0.19753086393766675,"w":0.36213991800944012,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.31976744172572058},{"h":0.021037585884157162,"w":0.60534998575846355,"x":0.19736055812572847,"y":0.33079649862737759,"t":"About an hour and a half. And don't forget to take pictures of the mountains.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.34857638502834765,"h":0.017192418218641814,"w":0.56611801147460938,"t":"They're all around you when you're on the boat and they look fantastic.","x":0.19740651920983718},{"y":0.36773255804559268,"c":1,"x":0.082304526332123679,"t":"VISITOR:","w":0.057613169352213556,"h":0.008720930389296444},{"h":0.010306242638397967,"w":0.10082304636637369,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","x":0.080246912927924255,"c":1,"y":0.38221436961400901},{"h":0.0089933745852628366,"c":1,"x":0.082263817146400228,"t":"VISITOR:","y":0.39811959176088973,"w":0.057694587707519521},{"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.41279069757192877,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"w":0.10082304636637371,"x":0.080246912925687724},{"y":0.36306410439724535,"x":0.1994377455977859,"t":"OK. And I assume there's a café or something on board?","h":0.016971354490174506,"c":1,"w":0.45091349283854154},{"t":"Sure. How old are your children?","x":0.19547324857197831,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"y":0.38074204922917954,"w":0.26543210347493484},{"y":0.3968023254592995,"t":"Er, my daughter's fifteen and my son's seven.","w":0.36625513712565105,"h":0.013091667521266781,"x":0.19753086752542326,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Right. Well there are various things you can do once you've crossed the lake,","x":0.19536682431763686,"y":0.41026345675759657,"w":0.61753229777018226,"h":0.01856190127674906},{"w":0.6318425496419271,"t":"to make a day of it. One thing that's very popular is a visit to the Country Farm.","y":0.42677568299769408,"h":0.016754295856848733,"c":1,"x":0.19334369885651986},{"y":0.4396047665946381,"t":"You're met off the boat by the farmer and he'll take you to the holding pens,","x":0.19528922656261272,"w":0.60124389648437504,"c":1,"h":0.02007173284344177},{"y":0.45638353877264204,"h":0.017816816538888114,"t":"where the sheep are kept. Children love feeding them!","w":0.43648361206054687,"c":1,"x":0.19328732594825737},{"t":"VISITOR:","x":0.080223813801609339,"y":0.47521113176815599,"w":0.059716981252034507,"h":0.0088800620134081854,"c":1},{"x":0.078053158638101389,"w":0.10317784627278645,"h":0.013062049137829823,"c":1,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.49013424344523848},{"c":1,"y":0.50542688547834957,"w":0.062302093505859385,"x":0.077922064299759841,"h":0.010283527441665052,"t":"VISITOR:"},{"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","x":0.080246912927924255,"y":0.52179034166085925,"w":0.10082304636637369,"h":0.0088339222614841617,"c":1},{"t":"VISITOR:","x":0.078189301517062729,"y":0.53633720908371463,"w":0.059670778910319008,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.55232558130750042,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"x":0.078189301560036312,"w":0.10288065592447918},{"w":0.3827160390218099,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"My son would love that. He really likes animals.","y":0.47379269706302374,"x":0.19341564288787377},{"x":0.19333177848467528,"w":0.58865422566731773,"c":1,"h":0.018078901742456632,"t":"Well, there's also a 40-minute trek round the farm on a horse, if he wants.","y":0.4880734980282504},{"w":0.45903523763020837,"x":0.19538315047282021,"t":"Do you think he'd manage it? He hasn't done that before.","y":0.50327041051144872,"h":0.017121140330643825,"c":1},{"w":0.33539095560709631,"t":"Sure. It's suitable for complete beginners.","y":0.52031802126090709,"x":0.19341563317505273,"h":0.014565699794126807,"c":1},{"x":0.19324699198108414,"c":1,"t":"Ah, good.","y":0.53439150514447797,"w":0.082641817728678402,"h":0.01551931513773952},{"w":0.58040827433268227,"x":0.19539670752137339,"c":1,"y":0.54930897414855495,"t":"And again, visitors are welcome to explore the farm on their own, as long","h":0.01641334268594663},{"h":0.01309851566669662,"y":0.56684334491191091,"w":0.5884773763020833,"c":1,"x":0.19547324583791625,"t":"as they take care to close gates and so on. There are some very beautiful"},{"h":0.016666195558294072,"w":0.60299799601236981,"c":1,"y":0.58084762639841059,"t":"gardens along the side of the lake which also belong to the farm - they'll be","x":0.19335423187443287},{"t":"just at their best now. You could easily spend an hour or two there.","x":0.19341564118316151,"y":0.59738372080885382,"w":0.53292180379231779,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.057613169352213542,"y":0.61337209277341487,"x":0.078189300509078422,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"t":"VISITOR:"},{"y":0.6292697288596607,"x":0.078189301364286451,"c":1,"h":0.010306242638398078,"w":0.098765430450439451,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:"},{"w":0.47736623128255207,"x":0.19341564968839131,"y":0.61189634874678389,"c":1,"h":0.014557139752750858,"t":"OK. Well that all sounds good. And can we get lunch there?"},{"t":"You can, and it's very good, though it's not included in the basic cost. You pay.","x":0.19125657046390207,"y":0.62647099811945339,"h":0.017502680262912684,"c":1,"w":0.62574111938476562},{"x":0.19104868091719235,"y":0.64215243537294953,"t":"when you get there.","w":0.16527216593424482,"h":0.016451569973931046,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.010495373441698375,"w":0.057725073496500648,"t":"VISITOR:","y":0.65972324348989142,"x":0.078133347914198528},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.19341563789493474,"y":0.65843023230640019,"w":0.049382715225219725,"t":"Right."},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"t":"Q1","x":0.83539094602634134,"y":0.33575581377647379,"w":0.026748971939086763},{"h":0.0090578908212615161,"c":1,"w":0.05771349589029949,"x":0.078139136725453015,"t":"VISITOR:","y":0.69895942666742228},{"w":0.10288065592447916,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.71366279044783343,"x":0.074074076307307737,"c":1},{"t":"VISITOR:","y":0.77607614805677594,"x":0.0761065497725157,"w":0.059721056620279947,"h":0.0088942154838284049,"c":1},{"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:","y":0.79210836304365084,"h":0.010306242638398189,"x":0.076131686590475714,"c":1,"w":0.10082304636637369},{"w":0.061953150431315121,"h":0.01223821156999394,"c":1,"y":0.82236926628828322,"x":0.071904083117273712,"t":"VISITOR:"},{"w":0.026748971939086985,"x":0.83333333286619049,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q2","c":1,"y":0.49127906959538237},{"x":0.83127571991409777,"w":0.02880658467610675,"c":1,"t":"Q3","y":0.56831395331135748,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.02880658467610675,"x":0.83127571991409777,"t":"Q4","y":0.61337209284624106},{"y":0.88515901061121482,"w":0.10082304636637368,"h":0.0088339222614840507,"c":1,"x":0.074074073419608061,"t":"TC EMPLOYEE:"},{"x":0.07407407366169963,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.057613169352213528,"c":1,"y":0.89970930221203249,"t":"VISITOR:"},{"x":0.19135801736456745,"y":0.69758539482688398,"w":0.49176956176757813,"t":"So is there anything else to do over on that side of the lake?","c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"c":1,"t":"Well, what you can do is take a bike over on the ship and then go on a cycling","x":0.19128503893069904,"h":0.017561195876769631,"w":0.62153818766276048,"y":0.71211588480016419},{"y":0.72770862923681345,"h":0.017248855743587921,"x":0.19126914742516174,"t":"trip. There's a trail there called the Back Road - you could easily spend three","w":0.61539245605468751,"c":1},{"x":0.19127407777607203,"w":0.62363337198893221,"c":1,"t":"or four hours exploring it, and the scenery's wonderful. They'll give you a map","y":0.74262444518963866,"h":0.017959640219860296},{"x":0.82098765495882597,"y":0.74563953471166133,"w":0.037037035624186254,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Q5"},{"h":0.014560564106288587,"c":1,"t":"when you get your ticket for the cruise - there's no extra charge.","x":0.19135803081604649,"y":0.76017441846940703,"w":0.51440327962239585},{"y":0.77470930219030754,"w":0.32304527282714846,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"What's the trail like in terms of difficulty?","c":1,"x":0.19135802191909959},{"c":1,"h":0.017822703708608278,"x":0.18923571039718298,"t":"Quite challenging in places. It wouldn't be suitable for your seven-year-old. It Q6","y":0.78920913651336377,"w":0.66679463704427078},{"t":"needs someone who's got a bit more experience.","x":0.18917275065269565,"y":0.80415042279849569,"h":0.017144507597978254,"w":0.39743123372395828,"c":1},{"x":0.19135802673533533,"w":0.59670781453450528,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"Hmm. Well, my daughter loves cycling and so do I, so maybe the two of us","y":0.8212209300847606},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.59876541137695316,"c":1,"x":0.18930042176524978,"t":"could go, and my wife and son could stay on the farm. That might work out","y":0.83716136629704685},{"x":0.18930041723439123,"t":"quite well. But we don't have bikes here... is there somewhere we could","w":0.57201644897460935,"h":0.014569124147664425,"y":0.85174418590744583,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"rent them?","x":0.18724279825492643,"y":0.86773255801628801,"w":0.09053497950236003,"c":1},{"y":0.88221437011473425,"h":0.016041443962932944,"x":0.18930042383068571,"t":"Yes, there's a place here in the city. It's called Ratchesons.","w":0.4711933898925782,"c":1},{"t":"Q7","c":1,"y":0.8837209299841905,"w":0.026748971939086985,"x":0.82921810664362527,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"y":0.89686985933919972,"h":0.018504347761893247,"c":1,"x":0.18913072117137206,"t":"I'll just make a note of that - er, how do you spell it?","w":0.41594248453776039},{"c":1,"t":"Example","w":0.074431832631429051,"h":0.015472747973474643,"x":0.83521206710618479,"y":0.2902287422695915},{"y":0.93313953468703803,"w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"x":0.88477366209442954,"t":"95"},{"h":0.017806331737864278,"w":0.2085117212931315,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96641811852927229,"x":0.39471442585841338,"c":1}],"h":3395}